<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U S West estimate raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U S West estimate raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dillon Read analyst Bill Vogel raised his 1997 forecast for U S West Communications Group to $2.55 per share from $2.50 after firm's 1996 fourth quarter results on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Maintains buy rating. Maintains 1998 estimate of $2.74.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The good news is attenuation of expense growth in the fourth quarter,&quot; he said. Growth in core businesses continued, particularly in value-added services, he said.</p>
<p>-- Stock closed 5/8 firmer at 34-1/8.</p>
</text>
